,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle got 44% of normal in November to December and 65% in August to September. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 37% of normal on the middle. Grid 15457 had its driest year in 2010 at 59%.</p>"}
